// Wobble bass: an LFO (#rate in Hz) sweeps the filter. Map #rate to tension!
// @name wobble
// @mode mono
// @gain 0.3
// @param cutoff 350
// @param rate 2

~lfo: sin #rate >> mul 0.5 >> add 0.5
~cut: ~lfo >> mul 6 >> add 1 >> mul #cutoff
~amp: ~gate >> adsr 0.005 0.1 0.9 0.08
~sub: sin ~freq >> mul 0.6
~body: saw ~freq >> lpf ~cut 4.0
out: mix ~body ~sub >> mul ~amp
